{
  "class": "DebugBlockValuePacket",
  "module": "server/play/debug_block_value_packet",
  "module_docs": [
    "Port of",
    "`net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.DebugBlockValuePacket`, plus",
    "the shared `net.minestom.server.network.debug.DebugSubscription` model the",
    "four debug packets use.",
    "",
    "# Value types",
    "",
    "Java registers sixteen debug subscriptions. [`ValueKind::Unit`] and",
    "[`ValueKind::VarInt`] are the two primitives. The other fourteen are",
    "[`ValueKind::Raw`]: that marker means the payload is a `debug.info` record",
    "(or a list of them), written and read through",
    "[`crate::network::debug::DebugSubscription::write_value`] /",
    "[`read_value`](crate::network::debug::DebugSubscription::read_value). The",
    "wire form (subscription id, then the presence boolean and the value) is",
    "unchanged."
  ],
  "struct": {
    "docs": [
      "Java: `record DebugBlockValuePacket(Point blockPosition,",
      "DebugSubscription.Update<?> update) implements ServerPacket.Play`.",
      "",
